    "body": "@davidkna Done. Swapped the setup-zig action for the `ziglang` PyPI package pinned at 0.13.0 (`pip install ziglang==0.13.0`); cargo-zigbuild picks it up via `python3 -m ziglang`. Added a Renovate custom manager in `.github/renovate.json5` that tracks that pin against PyPI, matching the existing workflow-tool managers.\n\nOn the `--version` flag: I read that as pinning via `ziglang==0.13.0`. Did you mean that, or pinning cargo-zigbuild too, or a `python -m ziglang version` check? I'll adjust to match.\n\nRe cross-rs: agreed it's worth a look. That's really why this PR exists though, since the riscv64 cross image is the blocker and fixing it upstream is a bigger separate effort. I can open a follow-up issue to track that so it doesn't get lost, and keep zigbuild as the unblock here.\n",
